From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: akramboussanni <92455979+akramboussanni@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:15:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] macos: Give the menu bar app the Kimono Prayer identity

Why: Kimono Prayer's menu bar app has to install and run beside the original
Mawaqit app without the two sharing anything, and people should see Kimono's
name, not Mawaqit's.

What must survive upstream changes:
- Info.plist: CFBundleIdentifier app.kimono.prayer.menubar, CFBundleName and
  CFBundleDisplayName "Kimono Prayer", location prompts name Kimono Prayer.
- Saved state lives in Application Support/Kimono Prayer/state.json, never
  upstream's Mawaqit folder (UserDefaults and Login Items follow the bundle id).
- The status item's autosave name, identifier and tooltip, the right-click and
  main menus (Open, About, Quit) and every on-screen message say Kimono Prayer.
- The Notification Settings deep link opens app.kimono.prayer.menubar's page.
- build-app.sh, release.sh and dmg-settings.py produce dist/Kimono Prayer.app,
  .zip and .dmg (volume "Kimono Prayer"). The executable and Swift target keep
  upstream's MawaqitMac name: it's internal, and renaming it only makes repairs
  harder.

diff --git a/macos/Info.plist b/macos/Info.plist
index a37fa24..beceb22 100644
--- a/macos/Info.plist
+++ b/macos/Info.plist
@@ -3,19 +3,19 @@
 <plist version="1.0">
 <dict>
     <key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key><string>en</string>
-    <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key><string>Mawaqit</string>
+    <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key><string>Kimono Prayer</string>
     <key>CFBundleExecutable</key><string>MawaqitMac</string>
-    <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key><string>com.akramb.mawaqit</string>
+    <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key><string>app.kimono.prayer.menubar</string>
     <key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key><string>6.0</string>
-    <key>CFBundleName</key><string>Mawaqit</string>
+    <key>CFBundleName</key><string>Kimono Prayer</string>
     <key>CFBundleIconFile</key><string>Mawaqit.icns</string>
     <key>CFBundlePackageType</key><string>APPL</string>
     <key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key><string>1.0</string>
     <key>CFBundleVersion</key><string>1</string>
     <key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key><string>13.0</string>
     <key>LSUIElement</key><true/>
-    <key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key><string>Mawaqit uses your location when you press the location button to offer local prayer times.</string>
-    <key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key><string>Mawaqit uses your location when you press the location button to offer local prayer times.</string>
+    <key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key><string>Kimono Prayer uses your location when you press the location button to find mosques and prayer times near you.</string>
+    <key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key><string>Kimono Prayer uses your location when you press the location button to find mosques and prayer times near you.</string>
     <key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key><string>Copyright © 2026 Akram Boussanni</string>
 </dict>
 </plist>
